Z||000002||jimmybpei||09-06-2001||08:45 PM||||Not So sure on that the 85 gt and 86 se had smaller valves in them. it wasnt untill 87 and up that the big valves came. <P>just wonder about performance gains when putting onto the older 2.8<P>heads will have .30 shaved three angle valve<BR>job, port and polish small block valve springs which are the same as 2.8. and comp cams 1.6 roller rockers. cam will be 440 with the roller rockers it should bring it to 478 lift not exactly sure on the duration <P>any comment or helpfull hints<BR>thanks <BR>Jimmy B||||reg||1
Z||000003||Joe Torma||09-06-2001||09:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jimmybpei:<BR><B><P>heads will have .30 shaved </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Careful about that...you'll mismatch the ports to the intake.  This is exaggerated on a 60degree block.<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif">  <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||87GTZ34||09-06-2001||09:39 PM||||Jimmy, Raydar is correct, all of the Fiero 2.8s had the performance heads.  Ever noticed how the trq/hp #s were pretty equal for all 4 years...||||reg||1
Z||000005||terryk||09-06-2001||10:01 PM||||All Fiero's V6's have the same heads. Same as all of the other MPFI iron head engines. Camaro's (S) and Citation/Ciera/Celebrity (W). Only the Z code carb engines had the same HO heads. <P>I have .060" shaved on the heads on the 3.2L. Don't do it. The intake seals on the block ends but it's pretty close. The intake was milled to match.<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 09-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||skitime||09-06-2001||10:21 PM||||Hey JimmyB,  How the caddy coming?  The 2.8 and the high performance 3.4 head are the same.  You can improve the head with the 3 angle grind but they are good heads already. I have a friend with a flow bench who plans to work on the heads the see where improvements can be made but he hasn't gotten around to them yet.  (BruceP on the forum) I will keep after him to get him to work on them.  <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
